Third-party software
====================

Jav3 invokes the following tools as separate programs. They are not
vendored or linked; each is installed from the host's package manager.

rclone — https://rclone.org
  Backups and restores of the state dir (backend/backup.py) shell out to
  rclone, including its crypt backend for the optional encrypted secrets.
